<p>Swiftly leap to your target and strike at their vital points with both weapons, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">131%, 144%, 154%, 162%, 170%</acronym> weapon damage. This attack deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 15%, 20%, 23%, 26%</acronym> increased critical strike damage.</p>